{"id":"32e788ac089e03ef","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-pa-completion-class.md","title":"PA 完整一致延伸的有效闭类","display":"thm-pa-completion-class — PA 完整一致延伸的有效闭类","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-pa-completion-class","aliases":["20-thm-pa-completion-class"],"display":"thm-pa-completion-class — PA 完整一致延伸的有效闭类","chapter":"10","section":"10.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Theorem 10.2.1；Remark 10.2.2","source_pdf_pages":[216],"source_printed_pages":[184],"depends_on":["[[20-df-completion]]","[[20-df-closed-class]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-pa-completion-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-pa-completion-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pa-completion-class — PA 完整一致延伸的有效闭类"},{"key":"chapter","html":"10"},{"key":"section","html":"10.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 10.2.1；Remark 10.2.2"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>216</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>184</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"379df91db6a6f0af\" href=\"?note=379df91db6a6f0af\" title=\"20-df-completion\">20-df-completion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\{\\chi_{\\{n:g(n)\\in T\\}}:\\operatorname{Completion}_{PA}(T)\\}\">\\(C=\\{\\chi_{\\{n:g(n)\\in T\\}}:\\operatorname{Completion}_{PA}(T)\\}\\)</span>；g 是固定可计算句子编号。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"379df91db6a6f0af\" href=\"?note=379df91db6a6f0af\" title=\"20-df-completion\">20-df-completion</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pa\\text{-}completion\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C),\\qquad C\\ne\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pa\\text{-}completion\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C),\\qquad C\\ne\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限串指定前若干句子的肯定／否定。长度阶段有界搜索从 PA 加这些有限决定推出矛盾的有限证明，发现则排除此串；全部有限决定一致的路径给一个完整一致理论。非空由 PA 的标准模型及 Lindenbaum 扩展得到。不从任意“n 行以内证明”偷得有限搜索，还必须同时限制公式、证明编码或枚举阶段。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 10.2.1；Remark 10.2.2；印刷页 184；PDF 第 216 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-completion","status":"resolved","id":"379df91db6a6f0af","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-completion]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-completion","status":"resolved","id":"379df91db6a6f0af","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-completion]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-completion]]；see [[20-df-closed-class]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C=\\{\\chi_{\\{n:g(n)\\in T\\}}:\\operatorname{Completion}_{PA}(T)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}pa\\text{-}completion\\text{-}class}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C),\\qquad C\\ne\\varnothing.","display":true}],"bytes":1413,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["379df91db6a6f0af","b73290a0af01d44f"]}